Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8250-xiaomi-alioth: connect USB VBUS supply

The Type-C port falls back to a dummy regulator when no VBUS supply is
specified. Connect the already enabled PM8150B VBUS regulator so TCPM can
enable the real 5V output when the port acts as a power source.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-xiaomi-alioth.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-xiaomi-alioth.dts
@@ -1052,6 +1052,8 @@
 	connector {
 		compatible = "usb-c-connector";
 
+		vbus-supply = <&pm8150b_vbus>;
+
 		power-role = "dual";
 		data-role = "dual";
 		try-power-role = "sink";
